    "udt_struct_v0": {
      "doc": "A missing storage entry means fall through to the default; a stored zero is an explicit zero.\\n`flat` is charged per send on top of the percentage, in the smallest units of the token\\nbeing sent. It is set per token and route only; the default fee must keep it at zero,\\nsince one stored number would mean a different value in every token.\\n`flat_native` is XLM stroops per send and is also allowed in the default fee.",
      "lib": "",
      "name": "FeeConfig",
